        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stick your head in a microwave to receive messages from god.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Microwave Yourself</i></strong> is a casual VR puzzle game. Find the correct combinations of items to put in the microwave (along with your head!) to unlock unique visual effects, music, and a message to advance your progress. You must find all three combinations in order to &quot;escape&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silly jokes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trial and error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relatively short (30-120 minutes)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small, interactable environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840810/extras/4a2afe83dfe0508edbc5cc280dd8d6fc.avif?t=1755468756\" width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Free yourself from torment.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Originally an academic project, this short VR experience is designed to take no longer than a couple of hours to complete. All music, art, and visual effects were made by a small team with love.)<br><br>(We also advise that you do NOT actually stick your head in a microwave!)</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stick your head in a microwave to receive messages from god.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Microwave Yourself</i></strong> is a casual VR puzzle game. Find the correct combinations of items to put in the microwave (along with your head!) to unlock unique visual effects, music, and a message to advance your progress. You must find all three combinations in order to &quot;escape&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silly jokes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trial and error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relatively short (30-120 minutes)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small, interactable environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840810/extras/4a2afe83dfe0508edbc5cc280dd8d6fc.avif?t=1755468756\" width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Free yourself from torment.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Originally an academic project, this short VR experience is designed to take no longer than a couple of hours to complete. All music, art, and visual effects were made by a small team with love.)<br><br>(We also advise that you do NOT actually stick your head in a microwave!)</p>",
